1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Student Attendance Management System — Sprint 2
Harsha K • Pradhyut • Suhas

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,500
Secure access
Password and one-time code. A dashboard for every role.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:18,230
Faculty signs in with a password and an authenticator code.

4
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:22,524
Two-factor verification protects access before the dashboard opens.

5
00:00:22,524 --> 00:00:26,500
The faculty dashboard shows assigned classes and attendance shortages.

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Record and correct
Save the roster, correct a mark and trace every change.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,658
Choose an assigned subject, the session date and the teaching period.

8
00:00:36,658 --> 00:00:42,300
Mark the full roster: S001 Absent, S002 Absent and S004 Present.

9
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:48,439
Save attendance. Reloading confirms that the marks are stored.

10
00:00:48,439 --> 00:00:58,529
A verified correction changes S001 from Absent to Present.

11
00:00:58,529 --> 00:01:04,533
The history preserves the editor, old and new status, time and reason.

12
00:01:04,533 --> 00:01:08,033
Reports and exports
Filter the saved records and download shareable reports.

13
00:01:08,033 --> 00:01:14,124
Build a report for the recorded date and the assigned class.

14
00:01:14,124 --> 00:01:19,166
After correction: 3 marks, 2 Present, 1 Absent — 66.67% attendance.

15
00:01:19,166 --> 00:01:28,767
The same filtered results can be downloaded as CSV and PDF.

16
00:01:28,767 --> 00:01:32,267
Student insights
Updated percentages, date filters and shortage notifications.

17
00:01:32,267 --> 00:01:37,462
The student dashboard reflects the saved correction immediately.

18
00:01:37,462 --> 00:01:45,637
S001 now has 75/101 in CS101 and 77/104 overall — 74.04%.

19
00:01:45,637 --> 00:01:49,853
Filter to the demonstration date to verify the corrected mark.

20
00:01:49,853 --> 00:01:55,027
For this date, the student attended 1 of 1 classes: 100.00%.

21
00:01:55,027 --> 00:02:01,000
In-app alerts explain when attendance falls below the 75% threshold.

22
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:04,500
Monitor and protect
Find attendance shortages and create an encrypted backup.

23
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:09,670
Admin has a system-wide view of students, classes and attendance.

24
00:02:09,670 --> 00:02:18,088
The shortage list identifies students needing follow-up, overall and by subject.

25
00:02:18,088 --> 00:02:21,346
Create an encrypted snapshot of accounts, attendance and application settings.

26
00:02:21,346 --> 00:02:29,500
The completed backup is listed and can be downloaded for safekeeping.

27
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:38,500
Thank you. Harsha K • Pradhyut • Suhas
